<title>USA: Exxon directors approve a 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Exxon directors approve a 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Corp said directors approved a two-for-one stock split payable April 11 to holders of record on March 14.</p>
<p>The company said it currently has 1.24 billion shares outstanding. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
